# Database Optimization Plan

Currently, the SkillArena database lacks performance indexes and automated storage cleanup. As the platform grows, queries will slow down and storage costs will artificially inflate. Here is the proposed plan to heavily optimize the database.

## User Review Required

Please review the proposed database changes below. Once approved, I will generate and run the SQL migration scripts to apply these optimizations permanently.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. [NEW] Foreign Key & Performance Indexes

PostgreSQL **does not** automatically create indexes on Foreign Keys. Right now, every time a student views a course, the database performs a full table scan to find the lessons. By adding B-Tree indexes, we can speed up queries from `O(N)` (Linear) to `O(log N)` (Logarithmic).

I will create the following indexes:
- `idx_lessons_course_id` on `lessons(course_id)`
- `idx_assignments_lesson_id` on `assignments(lesson_id)`
- `idx_submissions_user_id` on `submissions(user_id)`
- `idx_submissions_assignment_id` on `submissions(assignment_id)`
- `idx_submissions_status` on `submissions(status)` (Crucial for the Admin Dashboard to instantly load pending submissions)
- `idx_enrollments_user_id` on `enrollments(user_id)`
- `idx_lesson_progress_user_id` on `lesson_progress(user_id)`
- `idx_xp_log_user_id` on `xp_log(user_id)`

### 2. [NEW] Automated Storage Cleanup (Avatars & Thumbnails)

When an instructor uploads a new course thumbnail or a student uploads a new profile picture, the old image is left behind in the Supabase Storage bucket forever, wasting space. 

I will write a cleanup script/trigger that:
- Automatically deletes the old `avatar_url` from the bucket whenever a user updates their profile picture.
- Automatically deletes the old `thumbnail_url` from the bucket whenever an instructor updates a course thumbnail.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `EXPLAIN ANALYZE` on a common query (like fetching submissions) before and after the index creation to verify the switch from `Seq Scan` to `Index Scan`.

### Manual Verification
- Test uploading a new profile picture and verify the old image is completely removed from the Supabase bucket.
